  (text "MRB -- parallel LC tank, default 600 Hz (1H || 68n). 450/750 internal-only. The tank returns to GND THROUGH the footswitch (FS_MRB): switch closed = MRB on; open / no pedal = flat (R_fs_mrb only keeps the tank at 0 V DC). No pedal and MRB wanted: link FS1 pads 3-4." (at 141.6 -1.5899999999999999 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 018cdd12-09ee-4cbe-96a0-e59826c74ad1))
